      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "y405WHGpmLeMQ99-xirOu",
      "originalText": "every minute\nwrite in OLAP DB",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "a9TwswNU7CRzJqVSai8DS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2669.709444476139,
      "y": -2618.2558636495146,
      "width": 255.20005798339844,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "BDjYwcvP_EQ-qgj31cVMV",
      "index": "b8zZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 360838404,
      "version": 193,
      "versionNonce": 651007804,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786115680096,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-1 MB/sec or 1000 records/sec\n- shard by adId\n- retention policy 7 days",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-1 MB/sec or 1000 records/sec\n- shard by adId\n- retention policy 7 days",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_cMu0VBn82UzsbzjJCEMn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2706.1679259762404,
      "y": -2864.0559855680503,
      "width": 343.199951171875,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "VOZnQ-E4IrwC-496-eCsq"
      ],
      "frameId": "BDjYwcvP_EQ-qgj31cVMV",
      "index": "b8zb",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1799279292,
      "version": 350,
      "versionNonce": 669485700,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786115680096,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--> for some populer events\nwe need to shard further like hot shard\n- adId:0N, adId:1N ....",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> for some populer events\nwe need to shard further like hot shard\n- adId:0N, adId:1N ....",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QeMV4ml7ba7danqF8iZXw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2706.1679259280154,
      "y": -2800.0463979139163,
      "width": 677.5994873046875,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "VOZnQ-E4IrwC-496-eCsq"
      ],
      "frameId": "BDjYwcvP_EQ-qgj31cVMV",
      "index": "b8zd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 976263940,
      "version": 510,
      "versionNonce": 1410289596,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786115680096,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--> for fault tolerance, kinesis or kafka they \nare already fault tolerance and highly avalaible, \nbut *Flink job may go down*, so here we can use *retention policy* in stream\nlike kafka or kinesis provide, so we keep data till 7 days. so if flink goes \ndown we do not lose data",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> for fault tolerance, kinesis or kafka they \nare already fault tolerance and highly avalaible, \nbut *Flink job may go down*, so here we can use *retention policy* in stream\nlike kafka or kinesis provide, so we keep data till 7 days. so if flink goes \ndown we do not lose data",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
